comments.body:
@Luap99 I'd be happy to document this process, but I'm not sure what the best place is. Do you have recommendations on where something like this would be helpful to add?

I'd like to keep this issue open with feedback / thoughts from @baude (or others) on bringing back emulated architectures, or perhaps offering multiple machine images for the public - one with limited arches, and another with all of the arches. Otherwise, maybe docs are sufficient.

Also, I wanted to add that adding all of the architectures added ~200MB of disk size. Not sure if that makes a big difference as the base image is already 1.78GB, so 1.97GB (~10% bigger) doesn't seem all that different to me. 🤷
